FJj7uTQmE7p11zk-ycU8j2AN8q5w&oe=69DE3613"}, {"file_name": "Recording Radial Pulse Simulator_SS_05.png", "id": "837151848339615", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/43931336_837151851672948_3791241212278429846_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lN7gLT_bvMUQ7kNvwF1bOMY&_nc_oc=Adrc6UX0kdtO7NdZ61MEcnkX9diEHR1wosqR51cLimTetiwCPz53P8ZCplLj2x9MMsI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3BFvaD9KgLJX2bQByx9yhQgHYOUFH89mwrS91BJqtsTg&oe=69DE2927"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560X1440.png", "id": "3812821238933502", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982527_3812821242266835_422188521434867194_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vimb3T8T9A0Q7kNvwHPSq1u&_nc_oc=AdqKmHyiwuhkHzwIL1gQEbvaFUCq4Ofw42DFSEZQtWYA7ZY6o9qn_kw_WjxmzpaWuTE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2XyxhCn3Kpfkmygi-M4vBaZveiSfGJNkt1l9B12u43lQ&oe=69DE474C"}, "display_name": "Recording Radial Pulse Simulator", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This tutorial covers the essential steps for measuring and recording a patient's radial pulse. It includes preparation, locating the pulse, measurement, and documentation. By the end of this tutorial, learners will be able to: \n\nRemember the key steps in recording a radial pulse. \n- Understand the significance of pulse measurement in patient assessment. \n- Apply the correct techniques to ensure accurate pulse recording. \n- Analyze pulse data to detect any irregularities. \n- Evaluate their measurement accuracy and identify areas for improvement. \n- Create precise and thorough patient records based on their findings. \n\nThis comprehensive approach ensures CNAs are well-prepared to assist patients with feeding efficiently and compassionately in real-world clinical settings. ", "short_description": "Develop proficiency in accurately recording a patient's radial pulse."}]}, "developer_name": null, 